  "notes": "COMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {真似|まね}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to imitate)\n- 〜⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{真似|まね} (imitation of ~)\n- ⟦{馬鹿|ばか}→馬鹿：03574_baka⟧な{真似|まね} (foolish behavior)\n- ⟦{危|あぶ}ない→危ない：00768_abunai⟧{真似|まね} (dangerous behavior)\n- ⟦{猿真似|さるまね}→猿真似：27830_sarumane⟧ (blind imitation, monkey-see-monkey-do)\n\nUSAGE:\n{真似|まね} can be neutral (children learning by imitation) or negative (copying without understanding, or engaging in unacceptable behavior).\n\nRELATED VERB:\n- ⟦{真似|まね}る→真似る：10547_maneru⟧ (to imitate, to mimic)",
